                                                "sense_id": "c71b2265-f04f-3bb4-b64a-97d92e479de5",
                                                "text": "Perhaps it is simply common for wives to want their female friends to see their husband nude – especially if he has nice assets. Honestly, I also wanted to see the dick of Brian and Andrew."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05195da5-c544-433a-85b9-d2cf7ed2e503",
